sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Reviewer
    participant GIT
    participant JIRA

    Note over User,JIRA: Phase 3 — Review (single-step track)
    User->>Reviewer: cd worktree-<PARENT-KEY>, invoke /jira-task-reviewer (no key arg)
    Reviewer->>Reviewer: ensure_local_env.sh · statuscheck.sh --role reviewer<br/>(current_pr lists this branch's PRs — any FAIL → stop)
    Reviewer->>GIT: git fetch origin --prune
    Reviewer->>JIRA: fetch issue from branch key
    JIRA-->>Reviewer: issue (no subtasks → single-step)
    Reviewer->>Reviewer: resolve branch + base, phase check (reads current_pr)
    Note over Reviewer: a current_pr WARN or a CLOSED, unmerged PR → stop and ask

    alt No PR yet
        Reviewer-->>User: "no open PR yet — re-run once it exists"
    else PR open
        Reviewer->>GIT: 3a idempotency check
        GIT-->>Reviewer: prior verdict (none | APPROVED — | CHANGES REQUESTED —)
        Reviewer->>GIT: fetch PR diff
        GIT-->>Reviewer: diff
        Reviewer->>Reviewer: review 6 dimensions (correctness, patterns, scope, regressions, tests, hygiene)
        alt APPROVE
            Reviewer->>GIT: gh pr review --comment --body-file
            Reviewer->>JIRA: canonical report on parent (S-APPROVED)
            Reviewer-->>User: "approved — merge manually, no re-run needed"
        else REQUEST_CHANGES
            Reviewer->>GIT: gh pr review --comment --body-file
            Reviewer->>JIRA: transition parent → <STATUS_IN_PROGRESS>
            Reviewer->>JIRA: canonical report on parent (S-CHANGES-REQUESTED)
            Reviewer-->>User: "changes requested — fix, push & re-run"
        end
    else PR merged
        Reviewer->>JIRA: final report on parent (S-MERGED)
        Reviewer-->>User: "merged — complete (no re-run needed)"
    end
